ive job market. About Us & Services Learn about the Career Development Center staff, resources, support services, program\n                           and events. Learn More For Students & Alumni Access free resources, including career coaching, Focus 2 Assessment, events and more. Learn More For Employers Connecting current students, alumni and recruiters through job postings and career\n                           events. Learn More Contact us today! Erskine Hall, Suite 108 careercenter@ohiodominican.edu Make a Career Advising Appointment We can help you with: Columbus - A hot bed for professional growth and opportunities Capitalize on the Capital City. Going to college in the nation’s 15th-largest city means you get to learn first-hand\n                     why USA Today recently ranked Columbus as a Top 5 City to Start a Career. Columbus is home to: Five Fortune 500 16 Fortune 1000 companies 450 internationally owned companies We make it a priority to create relationships with businesses in the area – both small\n                                 and large! Career Development Center Information & Services For Students and Alumni For Employers & Recruiters Experiential Learning Process at ODU Facebook LinkedIn YouTube Instagram 1216 Sunbury Road Columbus, Ohio 43219 614-251-4500 Apply Visit Give Athletics Alumni Parents & Families Directory Campus Map Safety & Parking Business Office Calendar Careers at ODU © Privacy Policy Title IX Policy Compliance Reporting Website Assistance Social Media Ohio Dominican University, in fostering our Catholic and Dominican identity, respects\n                              and honors the dignity of each person regardless of age, race, ethnicity, religion,\n                              socioeconomic status, sexual orientation, gender identity, country of origin, disability,\n                              and other expressions of human individuality. Therefore, Ohio Dominican University\n                              is committed to 